# Maximum Carnage in a game of three. I (turn 1): until Bot1's next turn each creature attacks each combat if able and
# attacks a player other than Bot1 if able - a rule about a set (CR 611.2c), so it takes in Raging Goblins cast after it
# resolved, Bot1's own included, and every player's ("each"). Bot1's Goblin may not stay home; Bot2's may neither stay
# home nor attack Bot1 while Bot3 is there to attack, and Bot3's likewise attacks Bot2. No creature is goaded (the
# rulings). On Bot1's turn 4 the rule is over and his Goblin stays home; II adds exactly {R}{R}{R}. III (turn 7) deals 5
# to each opponent and none to Bot1, and the Saga is sacrificed (CR 714.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Maximum Carnage
Raging Goblin
Mountain
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Raging Goblin
Island x18

[Bot3 Deck]
